WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.348
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.618 --> 00:14.619
[♪ majestic orchestral music playing]

3
00:26.882 --> 00:29.885
[♪ music swells]

4
01:15.931 --> 01:18.558
[♪ music continues playing]

5
02:42.309 --> 02:43.643
[♪ music fades]

6
02:44.561 --> 02:46.813
[Eliza] A long, long time ago,

7
02:46.897 --> 02:49.524
there existed the Eastern Empire,

8
02:49.608 --> 02:53.278
a kingdom where magic was created from the arcane,

9
02:53.361 --> 02:56.281
a place where the sun's light reached first.

10
02:56.364 --> 02:57.699
SOVIESHU'S EAST PALACE

11
02:57.783 --> 03:02.537
Every corner of the Imperial Palace was filled with peace and happiness.

12
03:02.621 --> 03:03.747
EAST PALACE GARDEN EAST PALACE

13
03:03.830 --> 03:07.250
Before long, the cold armor of the battlefield

14
03:07.334 --> 03:09.544
had become a gentle warmth.

15
03:09.628 --> 03:12.005
My Emperor, Sovieshu.

16
03:12.088 --> 03:13.089
NAVIER'S WEST PALACE

17
03:13.173 --> 03:15.175
My Empress, Navier.

18
03:15.884 --> 03:19.054
The two had become husband and wife at a young age,

19
03:19.137 --> 03:21.681
promising to be each other's light.

20
03:22.682 --> 03:27.562
For Navier's sake, Sovieshu had never taken a mistress.

21
03:28.855 --> 03:34.444
But recently, rumors began to spread that unease was sprouting between them.

22
03:35.779 --> 03:40.283
This was because there still remained no child between the pair.

23
03:41.159 --> 03:44.079
The people, too, began to whisper.

24
03:44.162 --> 03:48.792
Yet Navier and Sovieshu remained as steadfast as ever,

25
03:48.875 --> 03:52.629
their strength could not be shaken by such words.

26
03:53.797 --> 03:55.799
[♪ captivating music playing]

27
04:22.868 --> 04:23.869
[♪ music fades]

28
04:55.734 --> 04:57.068
Where are you going?

29
04:57.152 --> 04:59.529
To check the speech for New Year's Day.

30
05:00.363 --> 05:01.865
[Sovieshu sighs softly]

31
05:01.948 --> 05:03.783
[laughs] Emperor.

32
05:09.831 --> 05:12.250
How about this for the ceremony?

33
05:13.168 --> 05:14.794
This would sound good.

34
05:21.092 --> 05:23.511
My Empress Navier

35
05:25.180 --> 05:27.390
is pregnant with her first child.

36
05:30.101 --> 05:33.271
At long last, a baby will be born in the palace

37
05:34.356 --> 05:35.941
to the royal line.

38
05:38.860 --> 05:40.403
People, rejoice.

39
05:41.780 --> 05:42.906
A blessing.

40
05:59.130 --> 06:00.131
[birds chirping]

41
06:01.841 --> 06:05.595
[Navier] "The cold armor clung to our skin so tightly that

42
06:05.679 --> 06:08.056
"we could not even prize it off,

43
06:08.598 --> 06:10.767
"and only the hot blood of our enemies

44
06:10.850 --> 06:13.561
"could melt away the biting cold.

45
06:14.437 --> 06:18.316
"Our swords and our shields have not rusted at all."

46
06:22.904 --> 06:24.739
[bird screeches]

47
06:27.283 --> 06:28.284
"A blade…

48
06:29.119 --> 06:30.620
"A blade that shines."

49
06:34.082 --> 06:35.125
[rustling]

50
06:37.794 --> 06:39.045
[horse snorts]

51
06:39.129 --> 06:41.131
[footsteps approaching]

52
06:48.304 --> 06:50.515
[♪ gentle music playing]

53
06:58.690 --> 06:59.858
Hmm.

54
06:59.941 --> 07:01.317
You're having a little one.

55
07:07.407 --> 07:08.658
[bird screeches]

56
07:19.919 --> 07:22.297
[tent door rustles]

57
07:30.930 --> 07:32.265
[Sovieshu exhales softly]

58
07:34.476 --> 07:36.770
A pardon for my uncle is being discussed.

59
07:45.945 --> 07:49.324
The consensus is leaning against incarcerating a royal

60
07:49.407 --> 07:50.450
for so long.

61
07:51.785 --> 07:56.372
He's the man who tried to seize power right after the death of the late Emperor.

62
07:57.624 --> 07:58.625
Believe me,

63
07:59.709 --> 08:01.628
if he's freed, it puts us in jeopardy.

64
08:02.712 --> 08:03.713
Mmm.

65
08:05.089 --> 08:06.090
[sighs]

66
08:11.971 --> 08:13.807
If only we had a child, Empress…

67
08:17.560 --> 08:20.146
no one would dare challenge for my throne.

68
08:34.702 --> 08:36.120
[Sovieshu sighs heavily]

69
08:46.047 --> 08:47.215
Let's go hunting.

70
08:49.926 --> 08:51.344
Come with me tomorrow.

71
09:02.397 --> 09:03.398
[Sovieshu sighs]

72
09:05.733 --> 09:07.443
[Marquess Lante] The hunt begins.

73
09:07.527 --> 09:09.571
Set up the barrier!

74
09:15.285 --> 09:17.287
[♪ enchanting music playing]

75
09:28.006 --> 09:29.382
[chimes]

76
09:33.887 --> 09:35.054
How long has it been

77
09:35.930 --> 09:37.849
since we did something like this?

78
09:38.474 --> 09:39.601
I couldn't say.

79
09:40.768 --> 09:41.936
It must be a while.

80
09:43.188 --> 09:45.273
But I do enjoy just talking with you.

81
09:45.356 --> 09:48.776
I'll never forget that first day we went out hunting.

82
09:49.360 --> 09:52.363
In those days, I was a more accomplished archer than you were.

83
09:53.823 --> 09:54.908
I'm grateful now.

84
09:57.619 --> 09:58.620
For what?

85
09:58.703 --> 10:01.414
You always made sure to catch less than I did.

86
10:01.497 --> 10:02.624
Held back.

87
10:03.333 --> 10:04.459
You noticed that?

88
10:06.711 --> 10:08.171
You shan't get a break today.

89
10:09.547 --> 10:10.715
[chuckles]

90
10:16.346 --> 10:18.556
[honking]

91
10:18.640 --> 10:19.849
[bells jingling]

92
10:19.933 --> 10:21.559
[beaters yelling indistinctly]

93
10:24.979 --> 10:26.022
[Sovieshu] Hyah!

94
10:26.689 --> 10:27.982
[horse whinnies]

95
10:39.285 --> 10:40.536
[bells jingling faintly]

96
10:41.120 --> 10:42.163
[horse neighing]

97
10:42.247 --> 10:43.373
[bells jingling]

98
10:43.456 --> 10:45.458
[panting]

99
10:46.084 --> 10:47.210
[guard] Hyah!

100
10:48.253 --> 10:49.254
Hyah!

101
10:49.754 --> 10:51.839
[guards panting]

102
10:52.924 --> 10:53.967
[Sovieshu] Hyah!

103
10:54.050 --> 10:56.052
[bird cawing]

104
10:59.639 --> 11:01.057
[bells jingle softly]

105
11:03.559 --> 11:04.644
[Artina] Wait.

106
11:06.104 --> 11:07.272
[bells jingling]

107
11:12.735 --> 11:15.280
-[jingling] -[beater yelling]

108
11:17.156 --> 11:18.700
-[grunts] -[horse whinnies]

109
11:18.783 --> 11:20.118
[exclaiming, yelps]

110
11:20.201 --> 11:22.829
[grunting]

111
11:22.912 --> 11:24.998
[groaning]

112
11:25.081 --> 11:26.291
[flies buzzing]

113
11:26.374 --> 11:27.375
Ugh!

114
11:28.376 --> 11:29.585
[gasps]

115
11:29.669 --> 11:31.170
[screaming]

116
11:31.254 --> 11:32.463
Whoa.

117
11:32.547 --> 11:34.090
[horse neighing]

118
11:34.173 --> 11:36.009
[exclaiming in fear]

119
11:36.884 --> 11:38.386
[panting]

120
11:38.469 --> 11:39.554
[flies buzzing]

121
11:39.637 --> 11:41.514
[♪ ominous music playing]

122
11:48.563 --> 11:49.564
[horse snorts]

123
11:50.440 --> 11:51.816
[beater] Oi!

124
11:52.859 --> 11:54.569
-[bells jingling] -Oi!

125
12:01.909 --> 12:03.036
[jingling]

126
12:10.335 --> 12:12.337
[♪ foreboding music playing]

127
12:13.379 --> 12:14.922
[rumbling]

128
12:15.006 --> 12:16.049
[screams]

129
12:17.884 --> 12:18.885
[bird cawing]

130
12:27.935 --> 12:29.896
[♪ low, tense music playing]

131
12:36.486 --> 12:37.487
[bow creaks softly]

132
12:38.363 --> 12:39.405
[snorting]

133
12:41.449 --> 12:42.617
[clinks]

134
12:42.700 --> 12:43.701
[rumbling]

135
12:43.785 --> 12:44.911
[boar squeals]

136
12:52.543 --> 12:54.629
-[beater] What's the matter, Your Majesty? -[Navier] Quiet.

137
12:54.712 --> 12:56.005
Oh.

138
13:14.982 --> 13:16.317
The bell, now.

139
13:18.778 --> 13:19.946
[bow creaks]

140
13:26.160 --> 13:27.412
[jingling]

141
13:28.538 --> 13:30.498
[low rumbling, thumps]

142
13:31.249 --> 13:32.250
[jingling]

143
13:32.333 --> 13:34.335
[loud rumbling]

144
13:38.214 --> 13:39.215
[trees thud]

145
13:39.298 --> 13:41.467
[horns blaring]

146
13:43.553 --> 13:44.554
What's that sound?

147
13:44.637 --> 13:46.806
It means danger, Your Majesty. We should flee at once.

148
13:46.889 --> 13:49.100
-Find the Empress first. -Of course. Ha!

149
13:49.183 --> 13:50.184
Hyah!

150
13:51.018 --> 13:52.603
Hyah! Hyah!

151
13:52.687 --> 13:54.689
-[bells jingling] -[beaters panting]

152
13:58.276 --> 13:59.902
[panting]

153
14:03.531 --> 14:05.241
[bells jingling]

154
14:08.911 --> 14:11.289
[panting]

155
14:13.082 --> 14:14.083
[grunts]

156
14:17.712 --> 14:18.921
[person screaming]

157
14:19.005 --> 14:20.047
Whoa.

158
14:23.426 --> 14:24.510
Hyah!

159
14:26.012 --> 14:27.930
-Your Majesty. -Protect the hunting grounds, be careful.

160
14:28.014 --> 14:29.515
I'll lure it away from here.

161
14:31.517 --> 14:33.060
-Hup! -[♪ suspenseful music playing]

162
14:33.144 --> 14:35.146
[bells jingling]

163
14:38.941 --> 14:40.943
[rumbling]

164
14:42.820 --> 14:44.363
[breathing heavily]

165
14:45.907 --> 14:47.408
[bells jingling]

166
14:51.329 --> 14:52.872
[horse neighs]

167
14:58.294 --> 14:59.337
[exhales]

168
15:01.047 --> 15:02.798
[bells jingling]

169
15:05.676 --> 15:07.428
[screeching]

170
15:11.515 --> 15:13.517
[♪ suspenseful music continues playing]

171
15:20.024 --> 15:22.026
[screeching]

172
15:30.534 --> 15:32.245
[continues screeching]

173
15:54.350 --> 15:56.143
[rumbling]

174
16:04.777 --> 16:06.404
[chimes]

175
16:12.076 --> 16:14.078
[♪ music fades]

176
16:14.161 --> 16:15.204
[panting]

177
16:27.758 --> 16:30.011
[breathing heavily]

178
16:30.094 --> 16:32.013
[screeching]

179
16:47.903 --> 16:49.947
[bird screeches in the distance]

180
17:06.172 --> 17:07.173
[panting]

181
17:07.757 --> 17:09.675
[yelps, groans]

182
17:09.759 --> 17:11.469
-[screaming] -[assassin 1 laughing]

183
17:11.552 --> 17:12.887
Where are you going now, huh?

184
17:12.970 --> 17:14.430
[assassins laughing]

185
17:14.513 --> 17:16.098
We've got you this time.

186
17:16.182 --> 17:18.392
-[grunts] -[assassins laughing]

187
17:19.685 --> 17:21.395
-Whoa. -[assassin 1] Stay still, damn it.

188
17:21.479 --> 17:23.689
-[victim grunting] -[assassin 2] Stay still. Come on.

189
17:23.773 --> 17:25.900
-[victim groaning, panting] -Hold still.

190
17:25.983 --> 17:26.984
-Huh? -[victim whimpers]

191
17:27.068 --> 17:28.194
That bastard, who is he?

192
17:28.903 --> 17:30.821
Did he follow this wench here?

193
17:30.905 --> 17:33.157
-Sir, don't go! -[assassin 2] Stay still!

194
17:33.240 --> 17:35.785
-[victim] Help me, please! -[assassin 1] This doesn't concern you.

195
17:35.868 --> 17:37.828
-Please help me! -[assassin 1] Hey, hey, hey.

196
17:37.912 --> 17:40.081
[assassin 2] Where are you running off to? Ah, shit.

197
17:40.164 --> 17:41.624
[assassin 1] Who are you?

198
17:41.707 --> 17:43.501
-Your horse looks nice. -[victim] Sir, please…

199
17:43.584 --> 17:44.794
-[assassin 1] Huh? -[victim grunts]

200
17:44.877 --> 17:46.712
-I want it. -[assassin 2 grunts]

201
17:46.796 --> 17:47.922
Get off!

202
17:48.506 --> 17:49.632
[grunts]

203
17:49.715 --> 17:51.050
[grunts]

204
17:51.133 --> 17:52.551
-[sword clangs] -[grunts]

205
17:53.719 --> 17:55.262
[yelling]

206
17:55.346 --> 17:57.640
-[Sovieshu] Hyah! -[horse whinnies]

207
17:57.723 --> 17:59.642
[neighing]

208
18:01.268 --> 18:02.645
[gasps]

209
18:03.145 --> 18:05.147
[♪ enchanting music playing]

210
18:13.322 --> 18:14.615
You little…

211
18:16.450 --> 18:17.827
[grunting]

212
18:17.910 --> 18:19.829
[groaning]

213
18:20.329 --> 18:21.872
[body thuds]

214
18:21.956 --> 18:23.791
[gasps, groaning]

215
18:23.874 --> 18:26.085
[screaming]

216
18:27.545 --> 18:29.547
[hoofbeats approaching]

217
18:30.715 --> 18:31.841
Whoa.

218
18:31.924 --> 18:33.384
Her Majesty is safe, my lord.

219
18:40.808 --> 18:41.809
The assassin.

220
18:41.892 --> 18:43.269
I want him caught alive.

221
18:43.352 --> 18:44.687
-Tell the Empress. -Yes, Your Majesty.

222
18:44.770 --> 18:45.771
Ha!

223
18:46.272 --> 18:47.857
[hoofbeats receding]

224
18:50.151 --> 18:51.485
[whimpering softly]

225
18:51.569 --> 18:53.571
[♪ gentle music playing]

226
19:29.398 --> 19:31.400
[♪ music continues playing]

227
19:48.667 --> 19:49.752
[horse snorts]

228
19:57.343 --> 19:58.886
[Sovieshu] Who are you?

229
19:59.970 --> 20:00.971
[victim] I am…

230
20:03.015 --> 20:04.683
Rashta is my name,

231
20:05.684 --> 20:06.852
noble sir.

232
20:08.354 --> 20:09.480
"Noble"?

233
20:10.439 --> 20:11.524
[chuckles softly]

234
20:17.112 --> 20:19.114
[♪ gentle music continues playing]

235
20:34.171 --> 20:35.714
[horn blowing]

236
20:35.798 --> 20:37.341
[Eliza] He must have returned.

237
20:41.554 --> 20:44.265
Your Majesty, I heard three murderers ambushed you.

238
20:44.348 --> 20:46.475
-You're not hurt, are you? -No, not at all.

239
20:46.559 --> 20:48.185
I was worried about you.

240
20:51.105 --> 20:52.314
Is it them on the cart?

241
20:54.733 --> 20:56.944
And you? I heard you encountered a beast.

242
20:57.528 --> 20:58.821
I trust you're not hurt?

243
20:59.488 --> 21:00.614
No, I'm well.

244
21:01.198 --> 21:03.659
The knights are searching for any others, so head indoors now.

245
21:04.368 --> 21:06.787
As for the assassins, order silence. Keep all of this quiet.

246
21:06.871 --> 21:08.539
I will, Your Majesty.

247
21:21.385 --> 21:23.721
[♪ captivating music playing]

248
21:30.769 --> 21:32.771
[♪ music swells]

249
21:45.743 --> 21:47.995
I heard you were hurt, my lady.

250
21:59.131 --> 22:01.258
The royal physician is here, Your Majesty.

251
22:08.515 --> 22:09.808
[Laura] Oh my goodness!

252
22:12.937 --> 22:14.146
Oh.

253
22:14.229 --> 22:15.856
Oh dear! [inhales sharply]

254
22:17.358 --> 22:18.359
[sighs]

255
22:18.817 --> 22:22.571
[physician] Fortunately, the muscle was not torn, Your Majesty.

256
22:22.655 --> 22:24.323
It could have been much worse.

257
22:33.123 --> 22:34.875
Has His Highness not returned?

258
22:34.959 --> 22:38.420
I'll be told straight away as soon as he gets back to the palace.

259
22:38.504 --> 22:39.505
Your Majesty, he'll be fine.

260
22:39.588 --> 22:41.632
Searching for an assassin must take a while.

261
22:43.258 --> 22:44.259
-[gasps] -Assassin?

262
22:50.516 --> 22:51.725
[door opens]

263
22:51.809 --> 22:54.061
[footsteps receding]

264
22:54.144 --> 22:55.187
[door closes]

265
22:55.980 --> 22:57.606
His Highness has ordered

266
22:57.690 --> 23:00.484
that no one speak of what happened this afternoon.

267
23:00.567 --> 23:02.152
Take care not to forget.

268
23:02.236 --> 23:03.570
[both] Yes, Your Majesty.

269
23:04.113 --> 23:06.782
-Countess, make sure this is done. -I will, my lady.

270
23:07.658 --> 23:08.951
Has everybody gathered?

271
23:09.034 --> 23:11.370
Yes, but it includes Lady Albani.

272
23:14.581 --> 23:15.791
Albani is here?

273
23:17.459 --> 23:20.671
Apparently, she intends to petition in earnest

274
23:20.754 --> 23:22.089
and plead for her husband's release.

275
23:25.259 --> 23:26.468
Treat her with care.

276
23:27.094 --> 23:28.679
She is a member of this house.

277
23:28.762 --> 23:29.763
[Eliza] Understood.

278
23:29.847 --> 23:31.181
[noble 1] Oh, yes!

279
23:31.265 --> 23:33.183
[Verdi] Her Majesty the Empress.

280
23:34.226 --> 23:36.061
[nobles] Your Majesty.

281
23:37.730 --> 23:39.023
I trust you're all well?

282
23:39.106 --> 23:40.858
We heard that you went out on a hunt.

283
23:40.941 --> 23:42.860
It was marvelous to go riding. I've missed it.

284
23:42.943 --> 23:45.070
[gasps] Oh my! Did you get hurt?

285
23:45.654 --> 23:46.822
I brushed against a tree.

286
23:46.905 --> 23:50.159
[gasps] Really, Your Majesty, you're astonishing.

287
23:50.242 --> 23:51.618
Hunting, of all things!

288
23:51.702 --> 23:54.496
[Navier] I heard from Lord Kosair that your son played a great role

289
23:54.580 --> 23:55.956
in defeating the Springwater Bandits.

290
23:56.040 --> 23:58.876
Do you mean that Lord Kosair knows of my son?

291
23:58.959 --> 24:00.252
-Of course. -[Pidot gasps]

292
24:00.335 --> 24:02.629
My brother awarded your late son with a medal.

293
24:02.713 --> 24:04.089
-Oh! -Oh my.

294
24:04.173 --> 24:05.716
-Oh, good heavens! -Oh my goodness!

295
24:08.052 --> 24:09.136
[clears throat]

296
24:13.849 --> 24:16.268
Albani, my dear, it's been a while.

297
24:17.811 --> 24:19.772
It's a real pleasure to be here.

298
24:19.855 --> 24:21.690
I'm delighted, Your Majesty.

299
24:27.613 --> 24:29.448
You're always welcome in this court.

300
24:29.990 --> 24:31.325
Thank you.

301
24:31.408 --> 24:33.243
I so enjoy visiting you.

302
24:33.327 --> 24:36.121
Please do let me share in your worries, my lady.

303
24:37.289 --> 24:39.083
Wouldn't it be better to have no worries at all?

304
24:40.042 --> 24:43.504
Nevertheless, your devotion is much appreciated.

305
24:44.213 --> 24:46.507
-Hmm. -[nobles chuckling]

306
24:51.428 --> 24:52.429
[scoffs]

307
24:53.597 --> 24:54.598
[scoffs]

308
25:00.938 --> 25:03.607
[noble 2] This may be a rather vulgar topic, but…

309
25:04.191 --> 25:07.611
I hear Count Yuji was caught having another affair.

310
25:07.694 --> 25:09.530
[noble 3] Who's the woman this time?

311
25:09.613 --> 25:11.865
[noble 2] I heard it's some young commoner.

312
25:11.949 --> 25:14.451
Still, how fortunate that this one's not a slave.

313
25:14.535 --> 25:16.245
[nobles laugh]

314
25:16.954 --> 25:18.872
You know, he really never gives it a rest, does he?

315
25:18.956 --> 25:19.957
[nobles laugh]

316
25:23.085 --> 25:24.211
[cart stops]

317
25:24.294 --> 25:25.504
[horse snorts]

318
25:31.385 --> 25:32.386
[guard] Get down.

319
25:35.222 --> 25:36.306
[Eliza] Your Majesty.

320
25:38.308 --> 25:41.728
His Majesty the Emperor has arrived safely at the palace, my lady.

321
25:46.775 --> 25:48.777
[♪ majestic music playing]

322
26:02.791 --> 26:04.168
[rat squeaking]

323
26:06.670 --> 26:07.838
[Rashta panting]

324
26:07.921 --> 26:08.922
[guard] Follow me.

325
26:11.383 --> 26:13.010
[assassin] Don't hurt me! [grunts]

326
26:13.093 --> 26:15.012
I don't wanna die! [groans]

327
26:16.180 --> 26:18.348
You dared to point your weapon at the Royal Emperor.

328
26:18.932 --> 26:20.517
I didn't know it was him…

329
26:20.601 --> 26:21.810
[grunts]

330
26:22.311 --> 26:23.645
You better start talking.

331
26:23.729 --> 26:25.147
[assassin] I'll do whatever you order.

332
26:25.230 --> 26:26.440
Please! Just spare my life!

333
26:26.523 --> 26:27.774
-[chain clinks] -[choking]

334
26:27.858 --> 26:29.568
-[squeaking] -[commander] Who is behind this?

335
26:29.651 --> 26:31.570
-Who ordered you to do it? -[assassin groaning]

336
26:31.653 --> 26:33.280
Speak if you want to live!

337
26:33.363 --> 26:35.365
[Rashta breathing shakily]

338
26:40.746 --> 26:42.539
-[keys jingling] -[cell door opening]

339
26:42.623 --> 26:43.624
[whimpering]

340
26:48.337 --> 26:49.713
[Rashta] Please, spare me.

341
26:49.796 --> 26:51.632
Please spare me. Please spare me.

342
26:51.715 --> 26:55.052
Please, I beg you, spare me. [sobbing]

343
26:58.055 --> 26:59.056
Please spare me.

344
26:59.139 --> 27:00.933
[sobbing] Where are you taking me?

345
27:09.983 --> 27:11.443
[crying]

346
27:17.699 --> 27:18.700
[door closes]

347
27:19.201 --> 27:20.702
[grunting softly]

348
27:30.337 --> 27:31.630
[breathing shakily]

349
27:31.713 --> 27:32.714
[zipper unzips]

350
27:35.258 --> 27:37.260
[♪ soft music playing]

351
27:43.141 --> 27:44.643
[exclaims]

352
27:59.992 --> 28:01.076
WHEN SUCH A CALM DAY WAS GRANTED TO ME,

353
28:01.159 --> 28:02.744
THE FIRST THING THAT CAME TO MIND WAS… A CHILD.

354
28:02.828 --> 28:04.830
[♪ somber music playing]

355
28:07.874 --> 28:09.751
[Sovieshu] If only we had a child, Empress…

356
28:11.378 --> 28:13.964
no one would dare challenge for my throne.

357
28:27.686 --> 28:29.146
[Eliza] You should go to bed.

358
28:29.229 --> 28:30.856
It's getting very late, my lady.

359
28:35.777 --> 28:37.571
Is there any more news about the assassin?

360
28:37.654 --> 28:39.990
And has his name been discovered?

361
28:40.073 --> 28:41.241
Or who ordered it?

362
28:43.452 --> 28:45.454
I've heard nothing. Shall I go and ask?

363
28:46.913 --> 28:47.914
No, don't go.

364
28:48.582 --> 28:49.750
We'll hear more in the morning.

365
28:52.127 --> 28:53.128
Sleep well then.

366
29:00.927 --> 29:02.012
[door opens]

367
29:02.929 --> 29:03.930
[door closes]

368
29:04.556 --> 29:06.099
[hooves clopping]

369
29:11.271 --> 29:12.689
[horse neighs softly]

370
29:12.773 --> 29:13.857
[sighs]

371
29:15.650 --> 29:16.651
[Charles] How did it go?

372
29:16.735 --> 29:17.861
[Albani] The ghastly witch.

373
29:17.944 --> 29:20.030
Already, all of high society has been filled

374
29:20.113 --> 29:21.615
with people on the Empress' side.

375
29:21.698 --> 29:24.493
The sly girl. We should've killed her off 15 years ago.

376
29:24.576 --> 29:26.286
It was that cunning wench's little schemes

377
29:26.369 --> 29:28.747
that let that Sovieshu boy steal the palace!

378
29:28.830 --> 29:31.792
[groans] And in my veins, the blood still boils when I think of that day!

379
29:31.875 --> 29:33.627
[laughs wryly] Good heavens.

380
29:33.710 --> 29:36.797
Everyone there praises and flatters and fawns all over her.

381
29:36.880 --> 29:39.007
And she loves it, that bogus empress.

382
29:39.091 --> 29:40.842
I'll wipe that smile off her face.

383
29:40.926 --> 29:42.636
-[grunts in frustration] -[sighs]

384
29:43.970 --> 29:46.264
Mother, you should be the one receiving praise.

385
29:46.348 --> 29:48.350
You and Father should rightfully have the palace,

386
29:48.433 --> 29:49.851
not those good-for-nothings.

387
29:49.935 --> 29:50.936
[groans]

388
29:55.565 --> 29:56.566
[sighs deeply]

389
29:59.277 --> 30:00.987
We'll do whatever it takes.

390
30:01.905 --> 30:05.200
Firstly, we must restore our titles

391
30:05.283 --> 30:06.493
and get our estate returned.

392
30:08.078 --> 30:09.329
Understand?

393
30:13.416 --> 30:14.751
That's our plan…

394
30:14.835 --> 30:15.919
Mmm?

395
30:26.763 --> 30:28.765
[♪ mischievous music playing]

396
30:38.942 --> 30:41.027
[♪ dramatic music playing]

397
30:43.905 --> 30:45.907
[panting]

398
30:48.827 --> 30:50.120
[letters thudding]

399
30:52.205 --> 30:53.331
NEW YEAR'S CEREMONY GUEST LIST

400
31:00.714 --> 31:05.719
INVITATION TO THE EASTERN EMPIRE'S NEW YEAR'S CEREMONY

401
31:08.096 --> 31:09.848
[Laura exhales] My goodness.

402
31:16.563 --> 31:17.689
[sighs heavily]

403
31:21.276 --> 31:23.486
-Your Majesty. -What is it, Laura?

404
31:23.570 --> 31:24.821
Well…

405
31:24.905 --> 31:26.031
So, His Majesty,

406
31:26.907 --> 31:29.159
after the hunt, he brought a woman here.

407
31:29.242 --> 31:30.410
A woman?

408
31:30.493 --> 31:31.578
Uh-huh.

409
31:32.746 --> 31:34.623
It sounds like the assassin, does it not?

410
31:35.248 --> 31:37.250
Oh, no. Not the assassin.

411
31:37.334 --> 31:40.837
His Majesty rescued a woman after finding her caught in a beast trap.

412
31:49.137 --> 31:51.264
[Verdi] So, what about this woman?

413
31:51.348 --> 31:53.099
[panting] This is what I've heard.

414
31:53.183 --> 31:55.769
That His Majesty made a real fuss of her.

415
31:55.852 --> 31:59.481
He ordered a luxurious bath for her with maids in attendance.

416
31:59.564 --> 32:02.567
They say that once they took off her muddy clothes and washed her,

417
32:02.651 --> 32:04.611
she was completely transformed and…

418
32:04.694 --> 32:06.655
[inhales deeply] …supremely beautiful.

419
32:06.738 --> 32:09.908
Now everyone's talking about it, from the attendants to the maids.

420
32:09.991 --> 32:11.159
Lady Laura.

421
32:12.452 --> 32:13.703
Uh…

422
32:15.288 --> 32:16.665
Please continue speaking.

423
32:19.042 --> 32:21.586
[Laura] After they cleaned her up, dressed her in fresh clothes,

424
32:21.670 --> 32:23.380
and brought her before His Majesty…

425
32:23.463 --> 32:25.048
Well, His Majesty…

426
32:28.134 --> 32:29.636
[clinking]

427
32:33.265 --> 32:34.516
[door opens]

428
32:45.485 --> 32:46.486
[door closes]

429
32:52.200 --> 32:54.202
[♪ gentle music playing]

430
33:37.287 --> 33:38.538
Tell me your name again.

431
33:43.793 --> 33:45.962
Rashta, Your Majesty.

432
33:48.465 --> 33:49.632
I deserve…

433
33:49.716 --> 33:52.385
death for failing to recognize Your Majesty,

434
33:52.969 --> 33:54.512
and yet I have only received

435
33:54.596 --> 33:58.266
such kindness that I can never repay.

436
33:58.892 --> 34:00.727
I don't know what to do with myself.

437
34:17.952 --> 34:19.496
[Sovieshu exhales]

438
34:30.673 --> 34:32.634
Call the physician and get her treated.

439
34:38.890 --> 34:40.100
[exhales]

440
34:53.947 --> 34:55.365
Our physician?

441
34:56.533 --> 34:59.577
He called the imperial physician for a lowly wench who no one even knows?

442
34:59.661 --> 35:00.662
Yes!

443
35:00.745 --> 35:03.623
The Emperor's acting like this girl has him utterly enchanted.

444
35:03.707 --> 35:05.083
Lady Laura!

445
35:05.166 --> 35:07.585
Keep quiet and don't be… insolent.

446
35:07.669 --> 35:09.003
Oh, no, my lady.

447
35:09.087 --> 35:11.589
It's dangerous. We need to stamp this out.

448
35:11.673 --> 35:14.050
Has His Majesty ever shown interest in any woman

449
35:14.134 --> 35:15.760
other than Her Majesty the Empress?

450
35:15.844 --> 35:17.137
He's always said he'd never take a mistress.

451
35:17.220 --> 35:18.388
I'd like you to leave.

452
35:18.471 --> 35:19.973
-No, I just-- -[shushes]

453
35:22.308 --> 35:24.185
Yes… My lady.

454
35:33.403 --> 35:35.113
I must ask, why did he take her?

455
35:36.030 --> 35:37.323
Huh?

456
35:37.407 --> 35:39.868
After she was washed, did she go to his chambers?

457
35:40.452 --> 35:41.536
[gasps softly]

458
35:43.663 --> 35:45.582
-Did they do it? -[gasps]

459
35:46.166 --> 35:47.500
[Eliza] I don't believe for a moment

460
35:47.584 --> 35:50.003
that His Majesty would ever behave improperly,

461
35:50.086 --> 35:53.006
but the ladies-in-waiting do have a point, Your Majesty.

462
35:53.089 --> 35:56.885
Perhaps you should speak with him and ask him what he intends to do.

463
35:56.968 --> 35:58.970
And mention these assassins as well

464
35:59.053 --> 36:01.014
to find out what really happened.

465
36:03.266 --> 36:04.267
I will do.

466
36:06.728 --> 36:08.772
I need to check the fees for New Year's Day,

467
36:09.397 --> 36:10.732
so please send the Minister in.

468
36:10.815 --> 36:11.858
Yes.

469
36:17.822 --> 36:19.282
[footsteps receding]

470
36:19.365 --> 36:20.366
[door opens]

471
36:21.701 --> 36:23.703
-[door closes] -[inhales deeply]

472
36:36.341 --> 36:37.801
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

473
36:38.384 --> 36:39.469
[chuckles softly]

474
36:39.552 --> 36:41.346
Go to the Eastern Palace right now.

475
36:41.429 --> 36:42.847
Find out what's going on.

476
36:42.931 --> 36:44.682
Something's changed since His Highness returned

477
36:44.766 --> 36:45.975
from the royal hunting grounds.

478
36:46.059 --> 36:48.102
Ask for any news of this girl.

479
36:48.812 --> 36:50.396
Find out every small detail.

480
36:58.071 --> 36:59.239
[coughing]

481
37:00.657 --> 37:02.575
Forgive me, I beg you.

482
37:02.659 --> 37:04.911
[sobbing] Please spare me. Have mercy on me.

483
37:11.000 --> 37:12.001
[sniffs]

484
37:12.085 --> 37:13.378
[guard] This is good.

485
37:19.092 --> 37:20.385
He's a manhunter?

486
37:20.468 --> 37:21.928
Yes, that is what they call

487
37:22.011 --> 37:24.389
those who hunt down runaway slaves or criminals.

488
37:24.472 --> 37:27.308
They strayed into the hunting grounds while chasing the woman near there.

489
37:27.392 --> 37:28.685
Can you be certain of that?

490
37:28.768 --> 37:31.271
We're still questioning him now, although his story sounds credible.

491
37:31.354 --> 37:34.482
There's a slave trader who lives in an estate just near our border.

492
37:34.566 --> 37:35.775
According to the assailant,

493
37:35.859 --> 37:38.361
there is quite a large bounty on the woman's head.

494
37:39.946 --> 37:42.073
How shall we deal with him, when we're done?

495
37:42.156 --> 37:44.117
I'll see to it once the interrogation's over.

496
37:44.200 --> 37:46.035
-We'll decide what to do then. -Yes.

497
37:46.119 --> 37:48.162
But… Sire… Sire.

498
37:50.164 --> 37:54.002
You will be careful during your dinner with the Empress, Your Majesty?

499
37:54.544 --> 37:56.045
[sucks teeth]

500
37:56.129 --> 37:57.922
-I'll be there. -Ah, but…

501
37:58.006 --> 38:00.008
[screeching]

502
38:00.091 --> 38:02.093
[♪ majestic music playing]

503
38:10.894 --> 38:11.895
[screeches]

504
38:28.119 --> 38:29.787
[screeching]

505
38:33.458 --> 38:34.459
Where's Her Majesty?

506
38:34.542 --> 38:36.419
She wanted to take a short walk. She'll come back.

507
38:36.502 --> 38:38.004
Did she go on her own?

508
38:38.087 --> 38:39.672
Well, I'm certain she has a lot on her mind.

509
38:39.756 --> 38:42.258
She must be thinking about this dinner with His Majesty.

510
38:45.053 --> 38:46.429
Should we let her go?

511
38:57.482 --> 38:58.691
[exhales softly]

512
39:04.781 --> 39:05.949
[bird screeches]

513
39:06.866 --> 39:08.868
[♪ delicate music playing]

514
39:25.093 --> 39:26.636
I think I know you.

515
39:26.719 --> 39:28.096
You are just like that bird

516
39:29.263 --> 39:30.640
who saved me at the hunt.

517
39:31.849 --> 39:32.850
[chirps]

518
39:34.310 --> 39:35.478
May I please touch you?

519
39:39.816 --> 39:40.817
[coos]

520
39:42.694 --> 39:44.696
[♪ music swells]

521
39:46.406 --> 39:47.824
[chirps]

522
39:54.580 --> 39:55.623
[chirping]

523
40:00.169 --> 40:01.671
You're a pretty little thing.

524
40:03.965 --> 40:05.133
[chirps]

525
40:07.010 --> 40:08.386
My goodness, you're a messenger.

526
40:09.595 --> 40:11.597
I wonder if you're delivering a letter.

527
40:28.740 --> 40:30.825
[sender] Wouldn't you say our meeting was fate?

528
40:32.702 --> 40:33.911
"Was fate"?

529
40:38.041 --> 40:39.042
[chirping]

530
40:40.168 --> 40:41.169
Hmm.

531
40:52.513 --> 40:53.514
[Rashta] Your Majesty.

532
41:03.232 --> 41:04.400
How's your leg?

533
41:05.860 --> 41:09.072
It's really doing very well now. Thanks to you, Your Majesty.

534
41:24.754 --> 41:26.297
How did you end up like this?

535
41:27.131 --> 41:30.384
Did your master punish you for wickedness?

536
41:33.971 --> 41:34.972
[chuckles softly]

537
41:36.974 --> 41:38.559
I'm not concerned with that.

538
41:42.105 --> 41:43.898
I wish to know all that there is.

539
41:45.316 --> 41:48.486
Such as who you are and where you are from.

540
41:54.408 --> 41:56.410
WOULDN'T YOU SAY OUR MEETING WAS FATE?

541
42:02.375 --> 42:05.586
[Navier] A fate that had lost its way found me,

542
42:05.670 --> 42:07.338
and now I send it back.

543
42:10.633 --> 42:11.717
May you reach

544
42:12.385 --> 42:14.512
the fate you seek.

545
42:19.767 --> 42:20.768
[bird chirps]

546
42:29.277 --> 42:30.403
Trust me, Rashta.

547
42:33.823 --> 42:34.824
Emperor…

548
42:35.700 --> 42:37.952
you should know I didn't do anything bad.

549
42:38.870 --> 42:41.330
I ran away out of fear of being killed.

550
42:41.998 --> 42:44.083
I was absolutely petrified.

551
42:44.167 --> 42:46.294
I was getting beaten badly.

552
42:46.377 --> 42:47.795
And that's my background.

553
42:50.047 --> 42:51.048
Hmm, yeah.

554
42:51.799 --> 42:52.800
It's all right.

555
42:53.467 --> 42:54.844
I understand very well.

556
42:56.387 --> 42:58.514
Once this injured leg is better,

557
42:59.182 --> 43:01.601
I'll be alone and thrown out of the palace.

558
43:02.977 --> 43:04.312
No such thing was said.

559
43:04.395 --> 43:05.646
It's natural.

560
43:06.814 --> 43:10.943
This palace is not the kind of place for a lost girl like me.

561
43:14.405 --> 43:16.407
But I beg you, Your Majesty.

562
43:16.490 --> 43:19.410
Please do not send me back to the place where my master is.

563
43:19.493 --> 43:22.121
If I go, he won't stop beating me until I'm dead.

564
43:22.205 --> 43:24.207
[sobbing]

565
43:27.668 --> 43:28.669
[sighs]

566
43:28.753 --> 43:30.755
[♪ soft music playing]

567
43:56.822 --> 43:58.282
Stop your crying.

568
44:23.474 --> 44:25.476
[♪ music swells]

569
44:43.869 --> 44:45.246
I will ensure

570
44:47.456 --> 44:49.709
you never endure such pain again.

571
44:55.840 --> 44:57.133
[sniffles]

572
45:07.518 --> 45:09.520
[♪ rousing music playing]

573
45:15.192 --> 45:16.444
[bird screeches]

574
45:33.669 --> 45:39.342
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

575
45:40.343 --> 45:42.345
[♪ closing theme music playing]
